[{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0313","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0313.toml","cve_id":"无","title":"海康威视综合安防管理平台 licenseExpire 接口远程命令执行漏洞","description":"海康威视综合安防管理平台（iVMS-8700/HikCentral）存在前台远程命令执行漏洞。攻击者通过向 /portal/cas/login/ajax/licenseExpire.do 接口发送特制POST请求，在JSON参数的operate或machines.id字段中注入系统命令，无需认证即可在服务器上以web权限执行任意命令，获取服务器控制权。该漏洞影响范围广，危害严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["HWPOC-2024-03ffd955"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2024-06-01","updated":"2024-06-01","remediation":"官方已发布安全更新，建议立即升级综合安防管理平台到最新版本；如无法升级，临时措施包括：限制 /portal/cas/login/ajax/licenseExpire.do 接口的访问来源IP，部署WAF规则拦截包含系统命令的请求体，或移除该接口的对外暴露。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-19T00:00:27.090642035+00:00","references":[],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0313.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0310","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0310.toml","cve_id":"无","title":"用友U8-Cloud RegisterServlet SQL注入漏洞","description":"用友U8-Cloud的RegisterServlet接口存在SQL注入漏洞，攻击者可在未授权的情况下通过POST请求向usercode参数注入恶意SQL语句，利用SQL Server的报错注入函数获取数据库敏感信息，导致数据泄露。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["HWPOC-2024-03fb6011"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2024-06-01","updated":"2026-07-18","remediation":"联系用友官方获取U8-Cloud安全补丁，升级至最新版本；或在应用服务器层面部署WAF规则，对RegisterServlet接口的usercode等参数进行SQL注入过滤；限制该接口的访问来源IP。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T09:16:21.801461508+00:00","references":[],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0310.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0033","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0033.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-24919","title":"Check Point Security Gateway 任意文件读取漏洞","description":"Check Point 安全网关（Security Gateway）在开启远程访问 VPN 或移动访问（Mobile Access）软件刀片并暴露至互联网时，存在路径遍历导致的任意文件读取漏洞。攻击者无需身份认证，只需向目标网关的 /clients/MyCRL 接口发送特制的 HTTP POST 请求，利用 aCSHELL/../../../../../../../ 形式的恶意路径穿越序列，即可越权读取设备上的敏感系统文件（如 /etc/shadow 等）。该漏洞影响启用了相关功能的 Check Point 量子安全网关及 CloudGuard 等产品，CVSS v3 评分为 8.6（高危），可被用于窃取凭据并进一步入侵内网。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.6,"aliases":["CVE-2024-24919"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2024-05-28T19:15:10.060","updated":"2026-06-17T07:15:13.443","remediation":"立即安装 Check Point 发布的预防性补丁（Hotfix）或升级至修复版本（Quantum Gateway R81.20 及更高版本、CloudGuard Network 及 Quantum Spark 最新补丁版本）。如无法立即应用补丁，建议临时禁用 Remote Access VPN 或 Mobile Access Software Blades，并通过防火墙限制外部对网关管理接口的访问，直至完成修复。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-17T00:00:00Z","references":["https://support.checkpoint.com/results/sk/sk182336","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2024-24919","https://www.mnemonic.io/resources/blog/advisory-check-point-remote-access-vpn-vulnerability-cve-2024-24919/","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2024/CVE-2024-24919.yaml","https://github.com/Expl0itD0g/CVE-2024-24919---Poc","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/6e5939e8074723d33adaf5b2f8b0352edab9ba8d/2024/CVE-2024-24919.md","https://github.com/rapid7/metasploit-framework/blob/55c089d2a295310b84afb8b920e3b7b375b530fa/modules/auxiliary/gather/checkpoint_gateway_fileread_cve_2024_24919.rb","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2024-24919"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2024/POC-AVE-2024-0033.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0033.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0020","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0020.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-35570","title":"因酷 inxedu 任意文件上传漏洞","description":"因酷（inxedu）教育平台 v2.0.6 版本的图像上传组件（\\controller\\ImageUploadController.class）存在任意文件上传漏洞。该组件在处理 /image/gok4 接口的文件上传请求时，未对上传文件的类型与内容进行严格校验，攻击者可在 fileType 参数中追加 jspx 等可执行脚本后缀，并将特制的 JSP 网页木马文件上传至服务器 Web 目录。攻击条件为：目标系统运行受影响版本的因酷教育平台且 /image/gok4 接口可公网访问，攻击者无需身份认证即可构造恶意 multipart/form-data 请求。成功利用后，攻击者可通过访问所上传的脚本文件在服务器上执行任意代码，从而完全控制服务器，造成数据泄露、系统被控等严重后果，CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级为严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2024-35570"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2024-05-23T19:16:01.747","updated":"2026-06-17T07:35:02.380","remediation":"建议立即升级因酷教育平台至 v2.0.7 或更高版本（已修复文件上传漏洞），并在 Web 服务器配置中禁止 upload 目录执行脚本（如 Nginx 配置 location ~ \\.jsp$ { deny all; }），同时在上传组件增加文件扩展名白名单校验、MIME 类型校验及文件内容检测，禁止上传 jsp/jspx/php 等可执行脚本文件。若无法立即升级，可在 WAF 层面拦截含 .jsp/.jspx 后缀的上传请求作为临时缓解。务必将上传目录移至 Web 根目录外并禁用脚本执行权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-17T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/KakeruJ/CVE/","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/6e5939e8074723d33adaf5b2f8b0352edab9ba8d/2024/CVE-2024-35570.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4d7236390d3d65194e590e3c8620543620af3984/cves/2024/35xxx/CVE-2024-35570.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/438494e0b0b98c6e92227268552b2c06f85b3be8/2024/35xxx/CVE-2024-35570.json","https://github.com/adysec/hwpoc/blob/760f2a0ac5ec983dd84c5e09cb5339a52f81c82b/docs/2024/%E5%9B%A0%E9%85%B7_%E5%9B%A0%E9%85%B7%E6%95%99%E8%82%B2%E5%B9%B3%E5%8F%B0rce-cve-2024-35570.toml","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2024/CVE-2024-35570.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6d3a932c05085f06507d23e5a0893fa8fe64ce42/CVE/data/2024/CVE-2024-35570.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2024/CVE-2024-35570.json","https://github.com/password123456/nvd-cve-database/blob/84e73462d0abe8774642a47d2d7bc3b1fe9aa9ac/2024/2024-05/2024-05-24/20240524_1716494405.json","https://github.com/aboutcode-org/aboutcode-mirror-euvd/blob/6fab7ea6c1d74d21cbcf0ffe9da81cc6b978c360/advisories/2024/05/EUVD-2024-35373.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_dedup/blob/35ff6751d9dde6c89382c34106bf8165b6ade361/data_out/CVE_similarity/CVE/CVE-2023-51928.json","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2024-35570"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0020.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0013","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0013.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-21683","title":"Atlassian Confluence 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Atlassian Confluence Data Center 与 Server 自 5.2 版本起存在一个高危远程代码执行漏洞（CVE-2024-21683，CVSS 8.8，CWE-94 代码注入）。已通过身份认证的攻击者可通过向 /admin/plugins/newcode/addlanguage.action 接口发送特制的 multipart/form-data 请求，利用新增语言功能注入恶意代码，从而在目标服务器上执行任意命令。该漏洞影响 Confluence Data Center 及 Server 多个受支持版本，对系统机密性、完整性与可用性均造成高影响，无需用户交互即可被利用，攻击者可借此完全控制服务器。Atlassian 建议用户升级至官方发布的最新修复版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2024-21683"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2024-05-21T23:15:07.923","updated":"2026-06-17T07:09:58.813","remediation":"Atlassian 已发布修复版本，Confluence Data Center 建议升级至 8.9.1 或 LTS 版本 8.5.9/7.19.22，Confluence Server 建议升级至 8.5.9 或 7.19.22。如无法立即升级，可通过反向代理或 WAF 拦截对 /admin/plugins/newcode/addlanguage.action 的访问请求，同时限制管理员面板的网络访问范围并启用多因素认证以降低未授权利用风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-17T00:00:00Z","references":["https://confluence.atlassian.com/pages/viewpage.action?pageId=1409286211","https://jira.atlassian.com/browse/CONFSERVER-95832","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2024/CVE-2024-21683.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/6e5939e8074723d33adaf5b2f8b0352edab9ba8d/2024/CVE-2024-21683.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/a6cbad21a8ff006125b5e5b00f9ab42bd00eac7c/2024/CVE-2024-21683.json","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/2cb2ea94fc4258318a8ccfcb4f378f44a19d8782/http/cves/2024/CVE-2024-21683.yaml","https://github.com/eeeeeeeeee-code/POC/blob/11c00cc5e129cb7d6ed8a99ef1fc108ae83719b8/wpoc/Confluence/Confluence%E8%BF%9C%E7%A8%8B%E5%91%BD%E4%BB%A4%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E(CVE-2024-21683).md","https://github.com/gelusus/wxvl/blob/becadd93d7cdff1310246e24c531079026fe8365/doc/2024-05/CVE-2024-21683%20Confluence%20RCE%20%E5%88%86%E6%9E%90%EF%BC%88%E8%AF%91%EF%BC%89.md","https://github.com/MrWQ/vulnerability-paper/blob/fcbdb421b62aef6ccac59a1887d94687f4faf9d6/bugs/%E3%80%90%E6%88%90%E5%8A%9F%E5%A4%8D%E7%8E%B0%E3%80%91Atlassian%20Confluence%20Center%20Server%20%E8%BF%9C%E7%A8%8B%E4%BB%A3%E7%A0%81%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E%20(CVE-2024-21683).md","https://github.com/W01fh4cker/CVE-2024-21683-RCE/blob/6d8921bb9966d4a2ff9dfa5b1726c8960023d69b/CVE-2024-21683.py","https://github.com/Threekiii/CVE/blob/b15267648d6c329465c8b4cfbeb7597850ead8c1/2024/2024.05/CVE-2024-21683%EF%BC%9AAtlassian%20Confluence%20%E7%99%BB%E9%99%86%E5%90%8E%E4%BB%A3%E7%A0%81%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E.md","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2024/CVE-2024-21683.rules","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/ac9605f5a915670fd80cb4e1904f4435f1835b65/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2024-21683_1.yaml","https://github.com/W01fh4cker/CVE-2024-21683-RCE","https://github.com/absholi7ly/-CVE-2024-21683-RCE-in-Confluence-Data-Center-and-Server","https://github.com/r00t7oo2jm/-CVE-2024-21683-RCE-in-Confluence-Data-Center-and-Server","https://github.com/phucrio/CVE-2024-21683-RCE","https://github.com/r3db34rdh4x/cve-2024-21683-rce","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2024-21683"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2024/POC-AVE-2024-0013.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2024/EXP-AVE-2024-0013.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0013.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0005","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0005.toml","cve_id":"无","title":"AJ-Report 开源数据大屏平台远程命令执行漏洞","description":"AJ-Report（anji-plus）开源数据大屏平台存在远程代码执行漏洞。攻击者可通过向 /dataSetParam/verification 等接口发送特制 POST 请求，在 validationRules 参数中注入可被服务端执行的恶意脚本（如调用 java.lang.ProcessBuilder 执行系统命令），从而在目标服务器上执行任意命令。该漏洞可导致攻击者获取服务器权限、登录管理后台并接管数据大屏，影响面广、危害严重。利用通常无需复杂身份认证，具备网络可达条件的远程攻击者即可发起攻击。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["NUCLEI-HTTP-CNVD-2024-CNVD-2024-15077-YAML"],"sources":["nuclei","cnvd"],"published":"2024-05-20","updated":"2024-05-20","remediation":"立即将 AJ-Report 从 1.4.0 及以下版本升级至 1.7.1.RELEASE 或 GitHub 仓库 master 分支最新代码并重新编译部署；升级前完整备份数据库与配置文件。若暂无法升级，在反向代理/WAF 中拦截路径含 /dataSetParam/verification 及分号后跟 swagger-ui 的请求，禁用或限制 Spring 对路径参数（path matrix）的宽松匹配，并将管理端口仅对可信内网开放，禁止公网直接访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-15T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cnvd/2024/CNVD-2024-15077.yaml","https://github.com/vulhub/vulhub/blob/master/aj-report/CNVD-2024-15077/README.md","https://github.com/wy876/POC/blob/main/AJ-Report%E5%BC%80%E6%BA%90%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E5%A4%A7%E5%B1%8F%E5%AD%98%E5%9C%A8%E8%BF%9C%E7%A8%8B%E5%91%BD%E4%BB%A4%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0005.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0360","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0360.toml","cve_id":"无","title":"广联达 LinkWorks DataSvc GetAllData 未授权访问漏洞","description":"广联达 LinkWorks（BIM协同平台）的DataSvc.asmx接口中的GetAllData方法存在未授权访问漏洞。攻击者无需任何身份认证即可通过POST请求调用该接口，获取系统中的用户数据、组织结构等敏感信息，可能导致信息泄露和进一步攻击。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["HWPOC-2024-04a94703"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2024-05-15","updated":"2024-05-15","remediation":"在Web服务器层面限制对/WebService/Lk6SyncService/MrMMSSvc/DataSvc.asmx路径的访问，配置IP白名单或添加身份认证机制；同时建议联系广联达官方获取安全更新。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-19T02:58:44.675333604+00:00","references":[],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0360.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0429","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0429.toml","cve_id":"无","title":"泛微公司Office OA系统 efolioer_in参数SQL注入漏洞","description":"攻击者可通过特殊构造的efolioer_in参数实现SQL注入攻击，攻击者可以读取敏感数据、修改数据库记录、获取数据库权限或进一步攻陷其他系统。该漏洞利用泛微OA的Java JDBC连接处理缺陷，在GET或POST请求中传递恶意SQL语句诱使目标数据库执行，可影响OceanBase等数据库系统。漏洞影响范围广，危害严重，攻击者无需权限即可获取数据库敏感信息，威胁企业数据安全和系统稳定。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["HWPOC-2024-05a35621"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2024-05-08","updated":"2024-06-15","remediation":"升级到泛微OEA 10.x系列最新版本，安装官方安全补丁包；更新系统到支持安全修复的版本；加强系统权限控制，限制数据库用户权限；进行安全渗透测试，发现并修复类似漏洞","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-19T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1519061/000110465925003924/form8-k_20240509.htm"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0429.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0019","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0019.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-33113","title":"{\"_meta\":{},\"stopReason\":\"end_turn\",\"usage\":{\"cachedReadTokens\":1664,\"inputTokens\":9241,\"outputTokens\":28,\"totalTokens\":10933}}","description":"D-Link DIR-845L 路由器固件版本 v1.01KRb03 及之前版本的 bsc_sms_inbox.php 接口存在信息泄露漏洞。攻击者可通过向 /getcfg.php 接口发送包含命令注入载荷的 a 参数（如 %0A_POST_SERVICES=DEVICE.ACCOUNT%0AAUTHORIZED_GROUP=1），绕过授权验证直接读取设备账户等敏感配置信息。该漏洞无需身份认证即可远程利用，CVSS 评分 5.3（中危），影响设备配置机密性。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.3,"aliases":["CVE-2024-33113"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2024-05-06T15:15:23.703","updated":"2026-06-17T07:31:27.160","remediation":"D-Link 已宣布 DIR-845L 进入 EOL/EOS 阶段，不再提供固件更新。建议立即停用并更换为仍在支持周期内的路由器设备。如无法立即更换，作为临时缓解措施：在管理界面禁用远程管理（WAN 侧访问），将管理端口限制为仅内网可访问；修改默认管理员密码为强密码；在防火墙规则中限制对 /bsc_sms_inbox.php 和 /getcfg.php 等敏感路径的外部访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-17T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/yj94/Yj_learning/blob/main/Week16/D-LINK-POC.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2024/CVE-2024-33113.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/6e5939e8074723d33adaf5b2f8b0352edab9ba8d/2024/CVE-2024-33113.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/a6cbad21a8ff006125b5e5b00f9ab42bd00eac7c/2024/CVE-2024-33113.json","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/2cb2ea94fc4258318a8ccfcb4f378f44a19d8782/http/cves/2024/CVE-2024-33113.yaml","https://github.com/rix4uni/cvemapping/blob/384d83313f24c48670edc1b1df2f06dc6de4a38c/2024/CVE-2024-33113/README.md","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/ac9605f5a915670fd80cb4e1904f4435f1835b65/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2024-33113_1.yaml","https://github.com/hack007x/veil_poc/blob/5cfe1da6e975ba816d728597885a5c5e79bda8bd/cves/2024/CVE-2024-33113.poc","https://github.com/zcyberseclab/zscan/blob/8c5a8daeed6afdf16f6945c24a51469d37a023b9/templates/apache/cve-2024-33113.yml","https://github.com/0x727/FingerprintHub/blob/6ee6c869a8c27db6524e9738db3e47a56e0329ab/plugins/dlink/dir-845l/CVE-2024-33113.yaml","https://github.com/jemus17/FOCI-Toolkit/blob/150a60dd4ce6539456b1efbb846ba46cd0e48a73/plugins/D-Link/D_LINK_DIR_845L%E6%8E%A5%E5%8F%A3bsc_sms_inbox_php%E5%AD%98%E5%9C%A8%E4%BF%A1%E6%81%AF%E6%B3%84%E9%9C%B2%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E_CVE-2024-33113.py","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6d3a932c05085f06507d23e5a0893fa8fe64ce42/CVE/data/2024/CVE-2024-33113.json","https://github.com/FaLLenSKiLL1/CVE-2024-33113","https://github.com/tekua/CVE-2024-33113","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2024-33113"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0019.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0498","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0498.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-32884","title":"gitoxide gix-transport 克隆URL中SSH选项注入远程代码执行漏洞","description":"gix-transport crate（gitoxide 的 Git 传输组件）未对 URL 中用户名部分的特殊字符进行充分校验，导致外部 SSH 程序可将该内容解析为命令行选项。攻击者可构造特制克隆 URL（如 `ssh://-oProxyCommand=...`），利用 SSH 选项走私机制，在受害主机当前工作目录包含恶意文件时触发任意代码执行。该漏洞影响 0.35.0、0.42.0 及 0.62.0 之前的所有版本，CVSS 评分 6.4，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.4,"aliases":["CVE-2024-32884"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2024-04-26T18:15:46.167","updated":"2026-06-17T07:30:36.977","remediation":"将 gix-transport 升级至 ≥0.35.0（v0.35 分支）、≥0.42.0（v0.42 分支）或 ≥0.62.0（v0.62 分支）。无法立即升级时，在调用 gix clone 前严格校验 URL 中 username 字段不含 \"-\" 开头及空格、$IFS 等特殊字符，禁止传入外部可控的克隆 URL。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/Byron/gitoxide/security/advisories/GHSA-98p4-xjmm-8mfh","https://rustsec.org/advisories/RUSTSEC-2024-0335.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-32884.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/362345baaa3b0376b2369a7901885756e250334b/cves/2024/32xxx/CVE-2024-32884.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/de1cbf8802a4c6060caaa5924b50812f2a62fead/cargo/gix/CVE-2024-32884.yml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/f3e6800281dab3089a8374b9fe419c8b8110ea36/2024/32xxx/CVE-2024-32884.json","https://github.com/rustsec/advisory-db/blob/7a086e691bff2c299fe16dda543daa3b5e7f4397/crates/gix-transport/RUSTSEC-2024-0335.md","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2024/CVE-2024-32884.md","https://github.com/Hashmire/cpeApplicabilityGeneratorPages/blob/4588dccb1f913705444975eb2a5eb79962bf2513/generated_pages/CVE-2024-32884.html","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1684cfa32e43376c48beb06819bce86de6ba421b/advisories/github-reviewed/2025/07/GHSA-5c5j-jmhx-q2gr/GHSA-5c5j-jmhx-q2gr.json","https://github.com/joaop9425/manual-do-tecnico/blob/cc6e0f5304777f18e55db554da5372bc31d4cae1/src/content/noticias/2026/02/18/seguranca/cve-2024-32884-gix-transport-indirect-code-executi-1771412946000.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4591185d8ea1fe47b6e30df3286bd52753a931ce/CVE/data/2023/CVE-2023-53158.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0498.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0012","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0012.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-21006","title":"Oracle WebLogic Server 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Oracle WebLogic Server Core 组件存在安全漏洞，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过 T3、IIOP 协议向目标服务器发送特制请求，成功利用后可未授权访问服务器中的敏感数据，导致机密性受损。该漏洞影响 WebLogic Server 12.2.1.4.0 及 14.1.1.0.0 版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高危。Oracle 已在 2024 年 4 月关键补丁更新中修复此漏洞，建议用户尽快升级至修复版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2024-21006"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2024-04-16T22:15:14.580","updated":"2026-06-17T07:08:20.627","remediation":"建议立即升级Oracle WebLogic Server至2024年7月关键补丁更新（CPU）修复版本：12.2.1.4.0升级至2024年7月PSU补丁（补丁编号35304436），14.1.1.0.0升级至2024年7月PSU补丁（补丁编号35304441）。若暂无法升级，可在防火墙层面限制T3/IIOP协议端口（默认7001/7002）仅限可信IP访问，或在WebLogic控制台启用\"Enable IIOP\"和\"Enable T3\"为false禁用相关协议作为临时缓解措施。建议尽快通过Oracle Support下载并应用官方补丁补丁包（p35304436_122140_Generic.zip / p35304441_141100_Generic.zip）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-17T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.oracle.com/security-alerts/cpuapr2024.html","https://github.com/d3fudd/CVE-2024-21006_PoC","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/6e5939e8074723d33adaf5b2f8b0352edab9ba8d/2024/CVE-2024-21006.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/a6cbad21a8ff006125b5e5b00f9ab42bd00eac7c/2024/CVE-2024-21006.json","https://github.com/eeeeeeeeee-code/POC/blob/11c00cc5e129cb7d6ed8a99ef1fc108ae83719b8/wpoc/Weblogic/WebLogic%E8%BF%9C%E7%A8%8B%E4%BB%A3%E7%A0%81%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E(CVE-2024-21006).md","https://github.com/arschlochnop/VulnWatchdog/blob/133a0d586d237a236f33d20e243ad929fcf9e0a4/data/2024/CVE-2024-21006-dadvlingd_CVE-2024-21006.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates-ai/blob/d476b10507a31f8cf4e68e148600e8de71a53d49/2024/CVE-2024-21006.yaml","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2024/CVE-2024-21006.rules","https://github.com/oscs1024/VulnIntel/blob/f62012ff68e6011291b2851d1c7ccdb8a587c013/2024-04/Oracle%20WebLogic%20T3/IIOP%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E8%BF%9C%E7%A8%8B%E4%BB%A3%E7%A0%81%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E%20(CVE-2024-21006).md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/64fd197c5b8f3e4f9493cb07798bdca54583505c/cves/2024/21xxx/CVE-2024-21006.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-21006","https://github.com/Vu1nT0tal/yarb/blob/f3ab325ae07c37962fd0266e62c446f77c3c9d2b/archive/2024/2024-04-20.md","https://github.com/lightr3d/CVE-2024-21006_jar","https://github.com/momika233/CVE-2024-21006","https://github.com/dadvlingd/CVE-2024-21006","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2024-21006"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0012.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0359","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0359.toml","cve_id":"无","title":"南京星源图科技 SparkShop 任意文件上传漏洞","description":"南京星源图科技 SparkShop 商城系统存在任意文件上传漏洞，攻击者可通过 POST 请求向 /api/Common/uploadFile 接口上传恶意 PHP 文件，无需身份认证即可获取服务器远程代码执行权限，进而完全控制目标服务器。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["HWPOC-2024-04a2236e"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2024-04-01","updated":"2024-10-11","remediation":"建议升级 SparkShop 至最新版本，在 uploadFile 接口增加文件类型白名单校验，限制仅允许上传图片等安全格式文件，并配置 Web 目录禁止执行 PHP 脚本。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-19T02:48:02.846192462+00:00","references":["https://github.com/Thejoyofgettingusedtolife/Thejoyofgettingusedtolife","https://github.com/satyr1203dd/SparkShop-UPLOAD"],"poc_urls":["https://github.com/Thejoyofgettingusedtolife/Thejoyofgettingusedtolife","https://github.com/satyr1203dd/SparkShop-UPLOAD"],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0359.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0073","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0073.toml","cve_id":"无","title":"金和OA MailTemplates.aspx SQL注入漏洞","description":"金和OA MailTemplates.aspx页面存在SQL注入漏洞。攻击者可通过构造恶意的tempID参数，在WAITFOR DELAY语句中注入SQL代码，导致数据库延迟执行，从而判断注入是否存在。该漏洞可被用于获取敏感数据，且无需身份认证即可远程利用。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["HWPOC-2024-00b155eb"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2024-04-01","updated":"2026-07-17","remediation":"升级金和OA至最新安全版本，对MailTemplates.aspx页面的tempID参数进行严格的输入过滤和参数化查询，禁止直接拼接用户输入构造SQL语句，同时部署Web应用防火墙(WAF)防护SQL注入攻击。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-17T18:50:34.435864266+00:00","references":[],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0073.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0347","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0347.toml","cve_id":"无","title":"用友时空KSOA系统PrintZPFB.jsp接口SQL注入漏洞","description":"用友时空KSOA系统/kp/PrintZPFB.jsp接口存在SQL注入漏洞，zpfbbh参数未进行有效的输入过滤与转义处理。攻击者无需身份认证即可通过构造恶意GET请求，在zpfbbh参数中拼接UNION SELECT等SQL语句，从而获取数据库名称、表结构、用户凭证等敏感信息。该漏洞利用门槛低，仅需发送特制HTTP请求即可触发，对使用该系统的企事业单位数据安全构成严重威胁。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["HWPOC-2024-04755cc7"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2024-03-31","updated":"2024-03-31","remediation":"对PrintZPFB.jsp接口的zpfbbh参数实施严格的输入校验，过滤单引号、UNION、SELECT等SQL关键字；改用预编译SQL语句或参数化查询替代字符串拼接；部署WAF规则拦截含SQL注入特征的恶意请求；联系用友官方获取KSOA系统最新安全补丁并及时升级。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T12:37:51.907981179+00:00","references":["https://github.com/4ra1n/CVE-2024-04755"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0347.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0017","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0017.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-29202","title":"JumpServer 堡垒主机 Ansible 模块 Jinja2 模板注入远程代码执行漏洞","description":"JumpServer（开源堡垒机）的 Ansible 组件中存在 Jinja2 模板注入漏洞（CWE-94），具有后台权限的认证攻击者可通过构造恶意的 Ansible 剧本，在 Celery 容器中触发模板注入，进而执行任意代码。由于 Celery 容器以 root 权限运行且可访问数据库，攻击者可窃取所有主机的敏感信息或篡改数据库内容。该漏洞影响 JumpServer v3.0.0 至 v3.10.6 版本，CVSS 评分 9.9，危害等级严重。官方已在 v3.10.7 版本中修复此漏洞。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.9,"aliases":["CVE-2024-29202"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2024-03-29T15:15:12.223","updated":"2026-06-17T07:22:37.197","remediation":"建议立即将 JumpServer 升级至 v3.10.7 或更高版本以修复该 Jinja2 模板注入漏洞。如无法立即升级，可在管理后台临时禁用 Ansible 相关任务执行入口，并严格限制具有 Playbook 创建/执行权限的后台账号访问，同时通过网络策略限制 Celery 容器对数据库及宿主机的访问作为缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-17T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/jumpserver/jumpserver/security/advisories/GHSA-2vvr-vmvx-73ch","https://www.sonarsource.com/blog/diving-into-jumpserver-attackers-gateway-to-internal-networks-2-2","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/6e5939e8074723d33adaf5b2f8b0352edab9ba8d/2024/CVE-2024-29202.md","https://github.com/Threekiii/Awesome-POC/blob/0f9e22b660cb1ea12c1c3668f9128d93e08da412/Web%E5%BA%94%E7%94%A8%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E/JumpServer%20%E8%BF%9C%E7%A8%8B%E4%BB%A3%E7%A0%81%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E%20CVE-2024-29201&CVE-2024-29202.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a23c9152c0ce51f4625e88e1e6abe715ca2d7579/cves/2024/29xxx/CVE-2024-29202.json","https://github.com/eeeeeeeeee-code/POC/blob/11c00cc5e129cb7d6ed8a99ef1fc108ae83719b8/wpoc/JumpServer/JumpServer(CVE-2024-29201)%E8%BF%9C%E7%A8%8B%E4%BB%A3%E7%A0%81%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E&(CVE-2024-29202)Jinin2%E6%A8%A1%E6%9D%BF%E6%B3%A8%E5%85%A5%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E.md","https://github.com/gelusus/wxvl/blob/98c7503d2600c12656769211c5fb49a5e292143f/doc/2024-04/%E3%80%90%E5%A4%8D%E7%8E%B0%E3%80%91JumpServer%20%E5%90%8E%E5%8F%B0%E6%A8%A1%E6%9D%BF%E6%B3%A8%E5%85%A5%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E%EF%BC%88CVE-2024-29202%EF%BC%89%E7%9A%84%E9%A3%8E%E9%99%A9%E9%80%9A%E5%91%8A.md","https://github.com/oscs1024/VulnIntel/blob/f62012ff68e6011291b2851d1c7ccdb8a587c013/2024-04/Jumpserver%3C3.10.7%20Jinja2%E6%B3%A8%E5%85%A5%E8%BF%9C%E7%A8%8B%E4%BB%A3%E7%A0%81%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E%20(CVE-2024-29202).md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/da9a3d5ccdbaba095f7b8771822dd7bd866db1c5/2024/29xxx/CVE-2